Something else which seems not to be common knowledge, too: there's no such
thing as a "defender" weapon.  SPFX_DEFN, in the code, actually means that
the weapon protects you from the second type of attack listed for the weapon.
(Someone misread the code).  So Excalibur protects against drain life attacks,
and the others are obvious (Frost Brand gives cold resistance, for instance).
